WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:04.900
3:14 AM, another alert.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.600
Most of them aren't real,
so people stop looking,

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.600
and that's when the real one gets missed.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.500
The person on site wants silence.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.100
The business wants trust.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.200
I realized they need the same fix.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.800
I looked at three ways in and picked
the one that lives inside the alert itself.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.600
Flag it in three taps.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.400
Pick a reason or just say it.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.400
And JARVIS tells you exactly
what your correction changed.

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.600
Success is simple.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:44.700
The same false alert never comes back.

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:49.000
JARVIS Alerts, every correction visible.
